DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260819T210000
UID:bat-202608191900-the-great-maria-bamford@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Maria Bamford is an acclaimed comedian and actress known fo
 r deeply personal\, experimental comedy about mental health. She created a
 nd starred in Netflix’s Lady Dynamite\, released several acclaimed stand
 -up specials\, and is widely recognized for voice work on shows including 
 Big Mouth\, BoJack Horseman\, and Bob’s Burgers.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/133141
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
